{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ telephone telephones) (+ fake hoax toy novelty) (+ \"alexander graham bell\" invented invention 1876))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_1002815967#0_2138487276","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1746","rank":1,"snippet":"Who Invented The Light Bulb And Telephone [Lewis Latimer]\" , \"segment\": \"Did Black man Lewis Latimer Invent The Light Bulb And Telephone - Ayupp News Home Fact check Did Black man Lewis Latimer Invent The Light Bulb And Telephone Fact check A news shared by African website claims that a Black Man Who Invented The Light Bulb And Telephone [Lewis Latimer] Published: 27, January, 2020 05:53:07 AM; Updated: 27, January, 2020 05:57:15 AM David image source social media Ad - Article Continues below<cover>Fake news claims: News shared by African website claims that a Black Man Who Invented The Light Bulb And Telephone [</cover>Lewis Latimer]. Growing up as a young Black child, very little is thought to you about Black inventors like Lewis Latimer and magnificent Black civilizations. The school’s curriculum around the world, and especially in Africa focuses more on the Caucasian inventors of the world. No one teaches our children of men like Lewis. Lewis Latimer remains to date the Africans who made the most impact on the world in the 20 th century. He co-founded the telephone and the durable light bulb.\" , \"start_char\""}}
