{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_24_926498109#8_1925542990","relevance":3,"reason":"This passage directly supports the information need: Western Union president William Orton rejected the opportunity to buy Bell's telephone company and dismissed the telephone as an 'electrical toy,' showing early lack of trust in its value.","learned":"A specific early business reaction was distrust/skepticism: Western Union's president dismissed Bell's telephone as an electrical toy."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"dismissing the telephone as an electrical toy\" (+ orton \"western union\" hubbard bell))","reason":"Use the distinctive direct phrase and related names to find additional documents that recount the same early dismissal of the telephone as not worth trusting commercially."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"dismissing the telephone as an electrical toy\" (+ orton \"western union\" hubbard bell))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_24_926498109#7_1925541721","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1761","rank":2,"snippet":"Policy, One System: Universal Service What AT&T Did (and Still Does) Transmission Switching Management The End of Monopoly After the Breakup SBC: Ma Bell's Heir Apparent? \" , \"segment\": \"the Bell telephone. At first the telephone got quite a bit of attention as a technological wonder, debuting at the Philadelphia Centennial Exhibition on July 25, 1876. But the initial excitement waned and customers were scarce. Bell returned to Scotland and left the business operations to Hubbard. Without visionary leadership, Bell Telephone looked as if it wouldn't last the decade, much less conquer the next century. Hubbard offered the company to William Orton, then president of Western Union, for $100,000. <cover>Orton passed, dismissing the telephone as an electrical toy. </cover>Companies like AT&T stick around for so long because they have great products and know how to treat their customers. Click here to learn all about customer relations. Advertisement Contents Theodore Vail One Policy, One System:\" , \"start_char\": 3249.000000 , \"title\": \"How AT&T Works | HowStuffWorks\" , \"url\": \"https://money.howstuffworks.com/att.htm\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_24_926498109#8_1925542990","rank":1,"relevance":3}]}}
