{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"people thought\" \"telephone\" (+ fake toy novelty useless impractical))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1144995795#10_2560482984","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1782","rank":3,"snippet":"NTSC Broadcasting for Television 20. Pagers 21. Traditional Design Tools 22. Dot Matrix Printers Subscribe to our newsletter! Please add any I missed to comments! Follow me on Twitter: @dvorsky Share This Story Get our newsletter DISCUSSION 11. Landlines \" , \"segment\": \"BrAt82 /Shutterstock. 10. Landlines Fixed home phones that use a solid medium <cover>telephone line, such as a metal wire or fiber optic cable, are still used by over a billion subscribers. But both you and I know it ain't meant to last. Advertisement 11. Answering Machines Pretty standard in all mobile phones now. 12. Cathode Ray Tube Televisions Advertisement The introduction of plasma and LED screens finally put an end to these ridiculously deep television sets. But they're not completely useless. How to mine for gold in your television set and computer keyboard Where do your computer, iPhone, and television go when they die?\" , \"start_char\": 5357.000000 , \"title\": \"22 Obsolete Technologies That People Thought </cover>Would Last Forever\" , \"url\": \"https://io9.gizmodo.com/25-obsolete-technologies-that-future-generations-will-n-1526922030\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_1336631551#1_2853922544","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_1336631551#0_2853920305","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
